{"path":"/ja/tip/01-37","title":"ギャンブル依存で借金をしてまで続けてしまい、気分が落ち込み続けている時は、まず 12356 に電話し、銀行カードと決済パスワードを家族に管理してもらう | HowToLiveBetter","description":"ギャンブル依存症で通院したことがある人の自殺死亡率は同年代の 15 倍、全死亡率は 1.8 倍である。自殺の兆候として事前に見抜けるのは抑うつである。したがって、借金をしてまでギャンブルを続け、情緒が落ち込み続けている場合は、まず 12356 に電話すること。","lang":"ja","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter ホーム","href":"/ja"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["本を読む"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["厳選50"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["今日のタスク"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["マイリスト"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["その他"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round